    "summary": "[Unshrouded Truth](vsdata:ability/aeldari.seer-council.unshrouded-truth) gets a new Target and Effect. It targets 1 **ASURYANI INFANTRY** unit of yours (not a **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** unit) that is within 9\" of a friendly **ASURYANI PSYKER** model, was not picked to move this phase and was not set up this phase. Its effect:\n\n- put the unit into **[Strategic Reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves)**\n- the unit has **[Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike)**\n- the unit is required to make an **[Ingress Move](vsdata:core-rule/ingress-move)** during this same phase, even in your first turn",
